  "description": "cmix v21 forced text-mode wrapper using mmap allocation, PAQ8 level 5, a 1000 MB PPMD cap, minimum PAQ8 main/text maps, lighter match maps, and the minimum PAQ rolling buffer. The binary and english.dic are gzip-compressed and counted toward program_size.",
